+ * netvsc_free_buf_pages - release a netvsc send/receive buffer.
+ *
+ * @addr: buffer address, or NULL if none was allocated (e.g. cleanup from a
+ *        failed allocation)
+ * @chunks: chunks array from netvsc_alloc_buf_pages(), or NULL
